<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank sets O/N repo to add mkt liquidity.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank sets O/N repo to add mkt liquidity.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) on Wednesday set an overnight repo tender to add liquidity, with the limit rate set at 18.25 percent.</p>
<p>The CNB said it would take two bids at a minimum of 100 million crowns before the deadline of 1030 a.m. (0830 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
